('golf2', 'dogadjaji', 'Koliko je osoba 31. jula 2026. na Sana Retro Festivalu stalo u jedan Volkswagen Golf Mk2, što je potvrdila agencija WRCAC?', 'How many people fitted into one Volkswagen Golf Mk2 at the Sana Retro Festival on 31 July 2026, as confirmed by the agency WRCAC?', '["12","20","16","26"]', '["12","20","16","26"]', 2, 'Rekord je postavio Oldtimer klub 1912 Sanski Most. Certifikat agencije WRCAC iz Londona izdat je 2. novembra 2026.', 'The record was set by the Oldtimer Club 1912 Sanski Most. The WRCAC agency in London issued the certificate on 2 November 2026.', 'Oslobođenje: Sanski Most ušao u svjetsku knjigu rekorda zahvaljujući popularnom Golfu 2 (6. 11. 2026.)', 'https://www.oslobodjenje.ba/magazin/zanimljivosti/sanski-most-usao-u-svjetsku-knjigu-rekorda-zahvaljujuci-popularnom-golfu-2/', true),
